{"id":"vod_hh_114945","vodId":"114945","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"六神合体","name_cn":"六神合体","date":"1981-01-01","year":"1981","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第64集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/60283bac838539513cbe77b23d7c5ae1.jpg"},"summary":"西历1982年，一道神秘的光芒落在了日本明神礁。为了消灭地球，异震星的祖鲁皇帝将还是婴儿的异震星人明神武（水岛裕配音）与装有反阳子炸弹的机器人盖亚一起送到了地球。17年后，明神武成长为一名心地善良的少年。此时，地球人类开始向宇宙进军。地球防卫军为了应对宇宙的突发事件而组成了精锐部队“CRUSHER”部队，明神武就是成员之一，担任COSMO CRUSHER的射击手。然而他的耳边总是萦绕着“玛兹！阻止地球人进入宇宙，爆破掉地球”的神秘声音。原来他就是祖鲁皇帝设计摧毁地球的玛兹。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-06 16:18:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en5QAnWd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b828n8ge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADqLyle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0Rqnvyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM8DqOOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ6Ox6Re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYQyBja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG6nkLKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ6OK55e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2k4P41d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aOYlj7Ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRQwXye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYQlQra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADqzDPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG6nJZ8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPlB8Pb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkZrZKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https